{"publicId":"3306d918-9ef4-4fb4-9f85-4922e9f0fe07","title":"Synaptics威胁开源社区并阻止DisplayLink驱动代码发布","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-06T07:34:52.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-06T07:34:52.000Z","digest":"Synaptics通过法律威胁阻止开源社区获取DisplayLink驱动代码，导致相关技术无法在Mac等设备上实现USB-C过桥显示功能。DisplayLink驱动原本用于支持USB-C转DisplayPort的技术方案，但Synaptics的闭源驱动程序存在质量缺陷。开源社区曾试图通过逆向工程获取技术细节，但Synaptics以专利侵权风险为由发起诉讼，迫使DisplayLink项目暂停。受影响设备包括部分支持USB-C过桥的新硬件，但Mac系统因硬件架构限制无法兼容该技术，用户需依赖Synaptics提供的闭源解决方案。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-07T12:14:37.221Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Synaptics 使用法律威胁阻止开源 DisplayLink 驱动","latestReport":{"id":"hxurle5e3rqtiuyukufy3s6ru"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fY1dnrVQdYzo","title":"Synaptics uses legal threats to block open-source DisplayLin","firstReportAt":"2026-11-06T07:34:52.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"hxurle5e3rqtiuyukufy3s6ru","title":"Synaptics 使用法律威胁阻止开源 DisplayLink 驱动","summary":"有公司对 AI 反向工程其软件采取法律行动，尽管这可能与 AI 部分无关。Synaptics 的现代驱动程序质量较差，但支持 USB-C 过桥显示技术的新设备提供了替代方案。遗憾的是，Mac 无法支持 USB-C 过桥 DisplayPort，导致使用相关设备时存在兼容性问题。","source":{"name":"Reddit r/opensource","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T07:34:52.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"hxurle5e3rqtiuyukufy3s6ru","title":"Synaptics 使用法律威胁阻止开源 DisplayLink 驱动","summary":"有公司对 AI 反向工程其软件采取法律行动，尽管这可能与 AI 部分无关。Synaptics 的现代驱动程序质量较差，但支持 USB-C 过桥显示技术的新设备提供了替代方案。遗憾的是，Mac 无法支持 USB-C 过桥 DisplayPort，导致使用相关设备时存在兼容性问题。","source":{"name":"Reddit r/opensource","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T07:34:52.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-07T13:00:00.000Z","heat":4.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T14:00:00.000Z","heat":4.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T15:00:00.000Z","heat":4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T16:00:00.000Z","heat":3.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T17: